      "reason": "Real gap in item 3: a declaration could have let a profile supply the engine-owned timeout or schema, defeating the action-review time limit. Item 3 now reserves model, effort, timeout, schema, root and confine, and the module reader refuses a declaration that lists one as a review option."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-04T18:36:51Z",
      "choice": "applied",
